      "<strong class=\"main-title\">Delivery overview</strong>",
      "<p class=\"section-intro\">Ledger Console turns a financial-interface problem into an inspectable set of deliverables. A reviewer should be able to trace each requirement from the page to its component, token, example or document. The dataset contains 42 fictional transactions across six currencies and five statuses; no funds move and no real account is connected.</p>",
      "<figure class=\"lc-example-window\" data-ledger-example=\"components\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-example-heading-components\"><div class=\"lc-example-caption\"><span class=\"lc-example-number\">LIVE 01</span><h3 data-lc-en=\"Resize, sort and inspect\" data-lc-zh=\"切换宽度、排序与查看详情\" id=\"lc-example-heading-components\">Resize, sort and inspect</h3><p data-lc-en=\"Change the layout width and open a transaction row.\" data-lc-zh=\"切换布局宽度，并打开一行交易查看详情。\" >Change the layout width and open a transaction row.</p></div><iframe src=\"projects/ledger-console/examples.html?example=components&amp;lang=en\" title=\"Ledger Console interactive example 01: Resize, sort and inspect\" data-lc-title-en=\"Ledger Console interactive example 01: Resize, sort and inspect\" data-lc-title-zh=\"Ledger Console 交互示例 01：切换宽度、排序与查看详情\" data-lc-example=\"components\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"clipboard-write\"></iframe></figure>",
