ens.css · tokens.ts</code></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lc-theme-branch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"lc-theme-modes\"><div class=\"lc-theme-mode\">\n      <div class=\"lc-theme-mini\" style=\"--mt-page:#08080D;--mt-surface:#141419;--mt-ink:#FFFFFF;--mt-muted:#B5B2C0;--mt-action:#6925F9;--mt-on-action:#FFFFFF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"lc-theme-mini-bar\"><i></i><span></span><b></b></div><div class=\"lc-theme-mini-card\"><strong>Aa 123</strong><span></span><span></span><i>↗</i></div></div>\n      <h4 data-lc-en=\"Dark\" data-lc-zh=\"深色\" >Dark</h4>\n      <code>tokens.css</code>\n      <small data-lc-en=\"Generated base\" data-lc-zh=\"生成的基础值\" >Generated base</small>\n    </div><div class=\"lc-theme-mode\">\n      <div class=\"lc-theme-mini\" style=\"--mt-page:#f6f5fa;--mt-surface:#ffffff;--mt-ink:#191622;--mt-muted:#625b70;--mt-action:#6925f9;--mt-on-action:#FFFFFF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"lc-theme-mini-bar\"><i></i><span></span><b></b></div><div class=\"lc-theme-mini-card\"><strong>Aa 123</strong><span></span><span></span><i>↗</i></div></div>\n      <h4 data-lc-en=\"Light\" data-lc-zh=\"浅色\" >Light</h4>\n      <code>themes.css</code>\n      <small data-lc-en=\"CSS overrides\" data-lc-zh=\"CSS 覆盖值\" >CSS overrides</small>\n    </div></div>\n    <div class=\"lc-theme-merge\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"lc-theme-node lc-theme-shared\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"/></svg><strong data-lc-en=\"Shared React components\" data-lc-zh=\"共享 React 组件\" >Shared React components</strong><div class=\"lc-theme-component-shapes\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>\n    <div class=\"lc-theme-reference\"><span data-lc-en=\"Documented mapping\" data-lc-zh=\"文档映射\" >Documented mapping</span></div>\n    <div class=\"lc-theme-node lc-theme-figma\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 8h6M9 12h4M9 8v9\"/></svg><strong>Figma</strong><code>COMPONENT_GUIDE.md</code></div>\n  </figure>",
      "<figure class=\"lc-example-window\" data-ledger-example=\"tokens\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-example-heading-tokens\"><div class=\"lc-example-caption\"><span class=\"lc-example-number\">LIVE 02</span><h3 data-lc-en=\"Adjust the design tokens\" data-lc-zh=\"调整设计令牌\" id=\"lc-example-heading-tokens\">Adjust the design tokens</h3><p data-lc-en=\"Change color, radius and spacing; test the preview action.\" data-lc-zh=\"调整颜色、圆角与间距，再点击预览按钮。\" >Change color, radius and spacing; test the preview action.</p></div><iframe src=\"projects/ledger-console/examples.html?example=tokens&amp;lang=en\" title=\"Ledger Console interactive example 02: Adjust the design tokens\" data-lc-title-en=\"Ledger Console interactive example 02: Adjust the design tokens\" data-lc-title-zh=\"Ledger Console 交互示例 02：调整设计令牌\" data-lc-example=\"tokens\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"clipboard-write\"></iframe></figure>",
      "<strong class=\"main-title\" id=\"lc-section-storybook\">Storybook and component documentation</strong>",
      "<p>src/stories/ makes component variants reviewable in Storybook, including monetary edge cases, statuses, active filters, long text, full/partial refunds, form validation and blocked states. The shared toolbar switches dark and light mode. Usage contracts and review paths are recorded in docs/COMPONENT_GUIDE.md and docs/DELIVERABLES.md.</p>",
      "<p>The Figma ↔ React relationship is documented rather than implied: Button references 22:25906 / 22:26058, Input references 22:26741, and the table-header treatment references 110:21982 in the supplied library. Ledger-specific components and interaction rules are implementation decisions. No complete library parity, Code Connect registration or automatic synchronization is claimed.</p>",
      "<figure class=\"lc-example-window\" data-ledger-example=\"storybook\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-example-heading-storybook\"><div class=\"lc-example-caption\"><span class=\"lc-example-number\">LIVE 03</span><h3 data-lc-en=\"Use the actual Storybook catalogue\" data-lc-zh=\"操作真实 Storybook 组件目录\" id=\"lc-example-heading-storybook\">Use the actual Storybook catalogue</h3><p data-lc-en=\"Choose a story and change its Controls. Storybook tool labels remain English.\" data-lc-zh=\"选择故事并修改 Controls 参数；Storybook 工具界面保留英文。\" >Choose a story and change its Controls. Storybook tool labels remain English.</p></div><iframe src=\"projects/ledger-console/storybook/index.html?path=/docs/components-moneytext--docs\" title=\"Ledger Console interactive example 03: Use the actual Storybook catalogue\" data-lc-title-en=\"Ledger Console interactive example 03: Use the actual Storybook catalogue\" data-lc-title-zh=\"Ledger Console 交互示例 03：操作真实 Storybook 组件目录\" data-lc-example=\"storybook\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"clipboard-write\"></iframe></figure>",
      "<strong class=\"main-title\" id=\"lc-section-states\">Boundary-state examples</strong>",
      "<p>The header exposes persistent loading, no transactions, long text, network error, permission denial and expired session. A search with no match shows a separate filtered-empty state with a clear-filters action. Loading remains inspectable until another demo state is selected.</p>",
      "<p>Blocked states hide transaction rows and filters. Local recovery restores fixture data while preserving filter selections; it does not authenticate a user or grant access. Long names and unbroken references wrap without truncating the identifier. These patterns are also isolated under Patterns/Boundary states in Storybook.</p>",
      "<figure class=\"lc-article-viz\" data-ledger-visual=\"states\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-viz-states\">\n<div class=\"lc-viz-heading\"><span class=\"lc-viz-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><h3 data-lc-en=\"Every state has a visible next step\" data-lc-zh=\"每种状态都有清楚的后续路径\" id=\"lc-viz-states\">Every state has a visible next step</h3></div>\n<div class=\"lc-state-route\"><span data-lc-en=\"Local request\" data-lc-zh=\"本地请求\" >Local request</span><span class=\"lc-viz-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span data-lc-en=\"Loading\" data-lc-zh=\"加载中\" >Loading</span><span class=\"lc-viz-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span data-lc-en=\"Records or an explained state\" data-lc-zh=\"记录或有解释的状态\" >Records or an explained state</span></div>\n<p data-lc-en=\"Open a state to inspect its presentation and recovery rule. These are the demo’s UI contracts, not live service controls.\" data-lc-zh=\"展开状态，查看呈现方式与恢复规则。这些是演示的界面契约，不是真实服务操作。\" class=\"lc-viz-caption\">Open a state to inspect its presentation and recovery rule. These are the demo’s UI contracts, not live service controls.</p>\n<div class=\"lc-state-grid\"><details class=\"lc-state-card\" open><summary><span data-lc-en=\"Loading\" data-lc-zh=\"加载中\" >Loading</span><span class=\"lc-state-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span></summary><div><p data-lc-en=\"Rows stay hidden while the loading state is shown.\" data-lc-zh=\"加载状态显示期间隐藏交易行。\" >Rows stay hidden while the loading state is shown.</p><div class=\"lc-state-recovery\"><strong data-lc-en=\"Next step\" data-lc-zh=\"后续路径\" >Next step</strong><p data-lc-en=\"Choose Normal to leave the persistent loading example.\" data-lc-zh=\"选择正常状态，退出持续加载示例。\" >Choose Normal to leave the persistent loading example.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"lc-state-card\" open><summary><span data-lc-en=\"No transactions\" data-lc-zh=\"无交易\" >No transactions</span><span class=\"lc-state-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span></summary><div><p data-lc-en=\"No records exist in the selected demo dataset.\" data-lc-zh=\"所选演示数据集中没有记录。\" >No records exist in the selected demo dataset.</p><div class=\"lc-state-recovery\"><strong data-lc-en=\"Next step\" data-lc-zh=\"后续路径\" >Next step</strong><p data-lc-en=\"Explain when records will appear; no unnecessary reset action.\" data-lc-zh=\"说明记录何时出现，不添加多余的重置操作。\" >Explain when records will appear; no unnecessary reset action.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"lc-state-card\" open><summary><span data-lc-en=\"No filter matches\" data-lc-zh=\"筛选无匹配\" >No filter matches</span><span class=\"lc-state-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span></summary><div><p data-lc-en=\"The dataset exists, but the current filters match nothing.\" data-lc-zh=\"数据存在，但当前筛选未匹配任何记录。\" >The dataset exists, but the current filters match nothing.</p><div class=\"lc-state-recovery\"><strong data-lc-en=\"Next step\" data-lc-zh=\"后续路径\" >Next step</strong><p data-lc-en=\"Clear filters to return to the existing records.\" data-lc-zh=\"清除筛选，返回已有记录。\" >Clear filters to return to the existing records.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"lc-state-card\" open><summary><span data-lc-en=\"Network error\" data-lc-zh=\"网络错误\" >Network error</span><span class=\"lc-state-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span></summary><div><p data-lc-en=\"The simulated request fails; no transaction rows are shown.\" data-lc-zh=\"模拟请求失败，不显示交易行。\" >The simulated request fails; no transaction rows are shown.</p><div class=\"lc-state-recovery\"><strong data-lc-en=\"Next step\" data-lc-zh=\"后续路径\" >Next step</strong><p data-lc-en=\"Retry restores the local demo and preserves filters.\" data-lc-zh=\"重试恢复本地演示，并保留筛选。\" >Retry restores the local demo and preserves filters.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"lc-state-card\" open><summary><span data-lc-en=\"Permission / session\" data-lc-zh=\"权限／会话\" >Permission / session</span><span class=\"lc-state-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span></summary><div><p data-lc-en=\"Permission denial and expired session have separate explanations.\" data-lc-zh=\"权限不足与会话过期分别提供对应说明。\" >Permission denial and expired session have separate explanations.</p><div class=\"lc-state-recovery\"><strong data-lc-en=\"Next step\" data-lc-zh=\"后续路径\" >Next step</strong><p data-lc-en=\"Restore demo access or session locally; no real authentication.\" data-lc-zh=\"在本地恢复演示访问或会话，不进行真实身份验证。\" >Restore demo access or session locally; no real authentication.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"lc-state-card\" open><summary><span data-lc-en=\"Long text\" data-lc-zh=\"长文本\" >Long text</span><span class=\"lc-state-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span></summary><div><p data-lc-en=\"All 42 records remain; one name and reference stress the layout.\" data-lc-zh=\"保留全部 42 条记录，用一个长名称与参考编号测试布局。\" >All 42 records remain; one name and reference stress the layout.</p><div class=\"lc-state-recovery\"><strong data-lc-en=\"Next step\" data-lc-zh=\"后续路径\" >Next step</strong><p data-lc-en=\"Wrap the full identifier; keep the table scrollable.\" data-lc-zh=\"完整标识符换行，表格保持可滚动。\" >Wrap the full identifier; keep the table scrollable.</p></div></div></details></div>\n</figure>",
      "<figure class=\"lc-example-window\" data-ledger-example=\"states\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-example-heading-states\"><div class=\"lc-example-caption\"><span class=\"lc-example-number\">LIVE 04</span><h3 data-lc-en=\"Trigger a state and recover\" data-lc-zh=\"触发状态并恢复\" id=\"lc-example-heading-states\">Trigger a state and recover</h3><p data-lc-en=\"Switch loading, empty, error, permission, session and long-text states.\" data-lc-zh=\"切换加载、空数据、错误、权限、会话和长文本状态。\" >Switch loading, empty, error, permission, session and long-text states.</p></div><iframe src=\"projects/ledger-console/examples.html?example=states&amp;lang=en\" title=\"Ledger Console interactive example 04: Trigger a state and recover\" data-lc-title-en=\"Ledger Console interactive example 04: Trigger a state and recover\" data-lc-title-zh=\"Ledger Console 交互示例 04：触发状态并恢复\" data-lc-example=\"states\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"clipboard-write\"></iframe></figure>",
      "<strong class=\"main-title\" id=\"lc-section-international\">Internationalization and accessibility</strong>",
      "<p>The ledger supports English and Arabic, with automatic RTL when Arabic is selected. Currency codes remain explicit, numbers use the documented Latin-digit convention, bidirectional isolation protects identifiers, and dates are consistently labelled UTC. All six fixture currencies use two decimals; the MoneyText examples additionally exercise zero- and three-decimal formats.</p>",
      "<p>Keyboard support includes a skip link, visible focus, native controls, result-count announcements, Enter/Space to open a row, and a drawer with Tab containment, Escape and focus return. Core targets are at least 44px. docs/I18N_ACCESSIBILITY.md records the review matrix and remaining native-speaker and assistive-technology checks; no WCAG certification is claimed.</p>",
      "<figure class=\"lc-example-window\" data-ledger-example=\"international\" aria-labelledby=\"lc-example-heading-international\"><div class=\"lc-example-caption\"><span class=\"lc-example-number\">LIVE 05</span><h3 data-lc-en=\"Try currencies, RTL and keyboard access\" data-lc-zh=\"试用币种、RTL 与键盘操作\" id=\"lc-example-heading-international\">Try currencies, RTL and keyboard access</h3><p data-lc-en=\"Switch locale and currency, then open and close the drawer using the keyboard.\" data-lc-zh=\"切换语言与币种，再用键盘打开和关闭详情抽屉。\" >Switch locale and currency, then open and close the drawer using the keyboard.</p></div><iframe src=\"projects/ledger-console/examples.html?example=international&amp;lang=en\" title=\"Ledger Console interactive example 05: Try currencies, RTL and keyboard access\" data-lc-title-en=\"Ledger Console interactive example 05: Try currencies, RTL and keyboard access\" data-lc-title-zh=\"Ledger Console 交互示例 05：试用币种、RTL 与键盘操作\" data-lc-example=\"international\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"clipboard-write\"></iframe></figure>"
    ]
